  "test_cases_written_not_run": [
    "full fixed cohort replays exact supplied-rate estimates without claiming billing or a model benchmark",
    "a failed429 and its retry both contribute recorded usage, latency and exact cost",
    "missing error usage is unknown and prevents complete totals rather than becoming zero",
    "malformed raw response is retained as a failed attempt with unavailable usage",
    "transport failure before a response retains explicit missing raw response and error",
    "partial usage keeps a known component subtotal while full estimate stays unknown",
    "missing prices or a different observed model never become a zero or applicable estimate",
    "a partial capture retains all15 item denominators and unknown attempt/item totals",
    "declared missing attempts and missing retry predecessors stay visible",
    "not-started and unknown-attempt-count items keep unavailable measurements",
    "interrupted pending attempt remains recorded and cannot supply final latency or complete cost",
    "unknown/duplicate items and altered question bindings refuse instead of changing the cohort",
    "duplicate attempts, forward retry references and changing retry request bytes refuse",
    "raw answers, HTTP outcomes and final attempt selection cannot contradict their record",
    "negative/nonfinite/backwards times and invalid price metadata refuse",
    "invalid raw usage stays unavailable, never counted as measured zero",
    "exact decimal rate arithmetic and changed report/raw ledger bytes are auditable",
    "source packet equality binds all15 availability rows but never proves rights or absence completeness",
    "source packet divergence, omitted availability, uncleared rights or split Unicode truncation refuse",
    "closed/source-assisted labels cannot bypass source-arm and tool-trace restrictions",
    "MCP success packets and explicit tool errors retain full and supplied result bindings",
    "changed accounting/scoring/data source bytes refuse without altering original fixtures",
    "declared finite-bound violations remain reported with their failed/retry costs",
    "bounded raw/JSON inputs refuse without a resource exhaustion experiment",
    "offline CLI creates private exclusive outputs, replays them and refuses input overwrite"
  ]
